%% UC-27 — View dashboard stats & moderate habit feed
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (adminStatsService / adminHabitService)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant N4 as Neo4j

    R->>AP: Open Dashboard
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/stats
    B->>M: counts (participants, responses, recommendations)
    B->>N4: counts (habits, contexts, BCIO mappings)
    B-->>AP: aggregated platform stats
    R->>AP: Open habit feed
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/habits/feed
    B->>N4: MATCH recent (:Habit) with contexts
    B-->>AP: paginated feed
    opt export
        AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/habits/feed/export
        B-->>AP: CSV download
    end
    opt session management
        AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/sessions / DELETE /sessions/:id
        B-->>AP: active sessions / revoked
    end
